WEBVTT

00:00:00.733 --> 00:00:02.526
I <b>was</b> at home last night.

00:00:05.592 --> 00:00:07.725
I <b>wasn’t</b> at home last night.

00:00:10.753 --> 00:00:12.353
You <b>were</b> very late.

00:00:15.459 --> 00:00:17.347
You <b>weren’t</b> very late.

00:00:20.393 --> 00:00:21.757
He <b>was</b> a teacher.

00:00:24.826 --> 00:00:26.309
He <b>wasn’t</b> a teacher.

00:00:29.395 --> 00:00:31.260
She <b>was</b> in bed at 10.00.

00:00:34.375 --> 00:00:36.575
She <b>wasn’t</b> in bed at 10.00.

00:00:39.608 --> 00:00:41.408
It <b>was</b> cold yesterday.

00:00:44.488 --> 00:00:46.435
It <b>wasn’t</b> cold yesterday.

00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:51.450
You <b>were</b> tired last night.

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:56.656
You <b>weren’t</b> tired last night.

00:00:59.771 --> 00:01:01.604
We <b>were</b> in Spain in May.

00:01:04.654 --> 00:01:06.840
We <b>weren’t</b> in Spain in May.

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:11.630
They <b>were</b> nice rooms.

00:01:14.702 --> 00:01:16.689
They <b>weren’t</b> nice rooms.

00:01:19.754 --> 00:01:20.981
<b>Was she</b> tired?

00:01:24.037 --> 00:01:25.737
Yes, <b>she was</b>.

00:01:28.774 --> 00:01:30.174
<b>Were they</b> at school?

00:01:33.271 --> 00:01:34.855
No, <b>they weren’t</b>.

00:01:37.918 --> 00:01:40.198
Where <b>were you</b> at 8.00 this morning?

00:01:43.261 --> 00:01:44.721
I <b>was</b> on the bus.